<section id="archery" style="background: #0F1020; color: #FFFFFF; border-top: 2px solid #0F1020; margin-bottom: 96px">
<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 32px; position: relative">
<svg viewBox="0 0 300 300" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; right: 16px; top: 40px; width: 240px; height: 240px; opacity: 0.5"><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="140" fill="none" stroke="#2A2C44" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="100" fill="none" stroke="#2A2C44" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="60" fill="none" stroke="#FF8A65" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="150" cy="150" r="22" fill="#D4FF3A"></circle></svg>
<p style="display: inline-block; margin: 0 0 20px; padding: 8px 14px; border: 1.5px solid #D4FF3A; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #D4FF3A; position: relative">Archery facts · 射箭小知识</p>
<h2 style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(38px, 5.5vw, 68px); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.15; position: relative">十环冷知识</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 48px; max-width: 620px; color: #D5D7E2; position: relative">一些我很喜欢的射箭小事，来自起射线，也来自裁判席。</p>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 0 48px; position: relative">
<img src="/images/archery-range.jpg" alt="室内射箭场上的训练" style="width: 100%; height: 460px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 24px; border: 2px solid #3A3D5C">
</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; position: relative">
<div style="padding: 28px; background: #1B1D33; border: 2px solid #3A3D5C; border-radius: 24px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif; font-size: 44px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; color: #D4FF3A">70 米</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #D5D7E2">奥运会反曲弓的射距。122 厘米的靶面上，金色十环的直径只有 12.2 厘米。</p>
</div>
<div style="padding: 28px; background: #1B1D33; border: 2px solid #3A3D5C; border-radius: 24px">
<p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif; font-size: 44px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; color: #FF8A65">十连冠</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #D5D7E2">自 1988 年设立女子团体项目以来，韩国女队拿下了每一届奥运会的女子团体金牌。</p>
</div>
<div style="padding: 28px; background: #1B1D33; border: 2px solid #3A3D5C; border-radius: 24px">
